0208 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301477 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301477 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301477 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186300208 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301477 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "4aa18da1-c7e8-5c56-9c36-c81d68a4cf4c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301491 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186300267 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301491 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301491 #edb/ref 1077 "field-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301491 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186300267 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186301491 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "50bc8c0f-557c-5e52-93ce-a4dfbf65cb8c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301316 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301368 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1069 "q-322774" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1071 "Express $\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $12{x}^{3}-20x+96$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ | __ |  |  | $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ |" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ffc55b0b-d2bb-5785-9bad-343d08c921b4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302125 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+9 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,12{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}0{x}^{2}-20x+96\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+30x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-50x+96 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-27x+45}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-23x+51\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $6x+9,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-23x+51.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}=6x+9+\\frac{(-23x+51)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1069 "q-325106" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the quotient of $-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3$ divided by $-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e902eb71-f118-50ae-bfee-7615e9d48833" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302174 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-3 \\\\  & -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-17{x}^{2}+3x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{4}+8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-13{x}^{2}+x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+6x-3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-5x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}-5x+6.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301270 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1069 "q-325110" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the remainder of $-6{x}^{4}+7{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+6x+2$ divided by $3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0daf2810-8b21-5a33-a2a3-5dad72a7a14f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302177 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x+1 \\\\  & 3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-6{x}^{4}+7{x}^{3}-\\phantom{0}8{x}^{2}+6x+2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{4}+4{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-\\,2x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $-2x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $4{x}^{2}-7x+6.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186301477 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1069 "q-325143" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the remainder of $-4{x}^{3}+16$ divided by $2{x}^{2}-3x+5?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "e563c3b5-1035-5672-9ab4-671fa924b598" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186302185 #edb/ref 1074 "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n-4{x}^{3}+16=-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+16\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x-3 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+\\phantom{0}0x+6\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-10x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6{x}^{2}+10x+16 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}+9x-15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+31\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-2x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+31.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186484823 #edb/ref 1080 "-4x+1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186484823 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186484823 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "02c9aef9-8d56-536c-ad1a-eb90516a9b6f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186484830 #edb/ref 1080 "2{x}^{2}-1" #ed